# Routes 206, 207 and 208 (the original's ROAD_D role: the Cycling Road's shade under the bridge, the rocky climb
# to Mt. Coronet, the farmland road to Hearthome City): a sturdy, upbeat mountain-road walk in C major, the brass
# section striding up over a climbing piano, a lydian lift for the open sky and the horn joining for the last
# stretch of the climb. Original composition for this game.
